msgid "Using OpenTracing"
msgstr "使用OpenTracing"

msgid ""
"This guide explains how your Quarkus application can utilize OpenTracing to provide distributed tracing for\n"
"interactive web applications."
msgstr "本指南解释了你的Quarkus应用程序如何利用OpenTracing来为交互式网络应用程序提供分布式跟踪。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "xref:opentelemetry.adoc[OpenTelemetry] is the recommended approach to tracing and telemetry for Quarkus."
msgstr "xref:opentelemetry.adoc[OpenTelemetry] 是 Quarkus 推荐的跟踪和遥测方法。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "When Quarkus will upgrade to Eclipse MicroProfile 6, the SmallRye OpenTracing support will be discontinued."
msgstr "当 Quarkus 升级到 Eclipse MicroProfile 6 时，SmallRye OpenTracing 支持将停止。"

msgid "This technology is considered {extension-status}."
msgstr "这项技术被认为是{extension-status}。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Being _deprecated_ means that this extension is likely to be replaced or removed in a future version of Quarkus."
msgstr "_废弃_ 意味着该扩展可能会在 Quarkus 的未来版本中被取代或移除。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "For a full list of possible statuses, check our https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-are-the-extension-statuses[FAQ entry]."
msgstr "如需查看所有可能状态的完整列表，请参阅我们的 link:https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-are-the-extension-statuses[常见问题解答] 。"

msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "先决条件"

msgid "To complete this guide, you need:"
msgstr "要完成这个指南，你需要："

msgid "Roughly 15 minutes"
msgstr "大概15分钟"

msgid "An IDE"
msgstr "编辑器"

msgid "JDK 11+ installed with `JAVA_HOME` configured appropriately"
msgstr "安装JDK 11以上版本并正确配置了 `JAVA_HOME`"

msgid "Apache Maven {maven-version}"
msgstr "Apache Maven {maven-version}"

#, fuzzy
msgid "A working container runtime (Docker or xref:podman.adoc[Podman])"
msgstr "一个可正常运行的容器运行时（Docker 或 xref:podman.adoc[Podman] ）"

msgid "Optionally the xref:cli-tooling.adoc[Quarkus CLI] if you want to use it"
msgstr "如果你愿意的话，还可以选择使用xref:cli-tooling.adoc[Quarkus CLI]"

